      value: You're back, meaning you've kill them.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6071641243366850594, guid: fb868a769ee77ec48b051ecba062e680, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialogueEnd.Array.data[1]'
      value: Thanks a lot for that.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6071641243366850594, guid: fb868a769ee77ec48b051ecba062e680, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialogueEnd.Array.data[2]'
      value: I'll tell a secret. You have to solved twos enigmas inside before accessing
        to the last room where you can ask for a wish.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6071641243366850594, guid: fb868a769ee77ec48b051ecba062e680, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialogueEnd.Array.data[3]'
      value: One of the enigmas needs  to be placed in order.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6071641243366850594, guid: fb868a769ee77ec48b051ecba062e680, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialogueEnd.Array.data[4]'
      value: 'Remember this, the right order going from the left to right is:'
