    - target: {fileID: 6071641243366850594, guid: fb868a769ee77ec48b051ecba062e680, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _monstersToKill
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6071641243366850594, guid: fb868a769ee77ec48b051ecba062e680, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _dialogueEnd.Array.size
      value: 3
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6071641243366850594, guid: fb868a769ee77ec48b051ecba062e680, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialogueEnd.Array.data[0]'
      value: Did you find him ?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6071641243366850594, guid: fb868a769ee77ec48b051ecba062e680, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialogueEnd.Array.data[1]'
      value: So he's been trap by monster all this time ?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6071641243366850594, guid: fb868a769ee77ec48b051ecba062e680, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialogueEnd.Array.data[2]'
      value: Thank you for helping him. And me.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6071641243366850594, guid: fb868a769ee77ec48b051ecba062e680, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialogueEnd.Array.data[3]'
      value: I own you one.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6071641243366850594, guid: fb868a769ee77ec48b051ecba062e680, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _dialogueBeginning.Array.size
      value: 5
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6071641243366850594, guid: fb868a769ee77ec48b051ecba062e680, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialogueBeginning.Array.data[0]'
      value: Hey, i can take a moment with you ?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6071641243366850594, guid: fb868a769ee77ec48b051ecba062e680, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialogueBeginning.Array.data[1]'
      value: My brother went on an adventure towards the ancient temple a few days
        ago.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6071641243366850594, guid: fb868a769ee77ec48b051ecba062e680, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialogueBeginning.Array.data[2]'
      value: But he hasn't come back yet.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6071641243366850594, guid: fb868a769ee77ec48b051ecba062e680, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_dialogueBeginning.Array.data[3]'
      value: I fear he's in danger, can you find him please ?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6071641243366850594, guid: fb868a769ee77ec48b051ecba062e680, type: 3}
